# Optional overrides loaded by .envrc through direnv.
# Create/edit .env.local only if needed; it is ignored by Git.
# Without direnv, use `set -gx NAME value` in the current Fish session instead.
# See docs/getting-started.md and docs/apple-signing.md.

# Default: /Applications/Xcode-beta.app/Contents/Developer
# PINSHIFT_DEVELOPER_DIR="/Applications/Xcode.app/Contents/Developer"

# Usually unnecessary: a single paired physical iPhone is discovered automatically.
# PINSHIFT_DEVICE="Your actual iPhone name or private identifier"

# Needed only when automatic selection finds zero or multiple signing identities.
# PINSHIFT_CODE_SIGN_IDENTITY="40-character certificate fingerprint"

# Every Apply is fixed at 180 seconds. There is no duration override here.
